							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "This command deploys a docker container by creating a pod. So it first creates a pod automatically and deploys an instance of the nginx docker image. But where does it get the application image from? for that you need to specify the image name using the image parameter. you can configure kubernetes to pull the image from the public docker hub or a private repository within the organisation"
