							},
							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "How excatly do we update deployment?. When I say update it could be different things, such as updating your application version by updating the version of Docker containers used, updating their labels, or updating the number of replicas, etc. Since we already have a deployment defination file, it is easy for us to modify this file once we make the necessary changes, "
								}
							]
						}
					]
				}
			},
